OL,5,G2030 The Fenn Street Gang
OL,6,     FTaking a girlfriend home for the
OL,7,     Ffirst time is always a
OL,8,     Fnerve-racking experience. However,
OL,9,     Fwhen you have a mother like
OL,10,     FFrankie's, the confrontation is
OL,11,     Fparticularly difficult!
OL,12,G2100 Space 1999
OL,13,     FA battle for life with rock that
OL,14,     Fpulsates with power, energy,
OL,15,     Fintelligence and purpose.
OL,16,G2200 Malibu Beach
OL,17,     FUnder the blazing sun, passions
OL,18,     Fsimmer as desire, jealousy and
OL,19,     Ftemptation ignite among a group of
OL,20,     Fcarefree beachgoers, turning a
OL,21,     Fsummer of fun into a sultry game
OL,22,     Fof attraction and rivalry.
